-# Lumo Test 2.10.6 for Android
+# Lumo Test 2.11.0 for Android
+
+Version 2.11.0 adds shared service availability on top of the corrected 2.10.6 consumer journeys. Install over 2.10.6 with the same package and signing certificate. The app polls the public availability endpoint while foregrounded and also consumes status included in authorised account snapshots. A manually paused, unhealthy, recovering or stale service disables the corresponding new-payment choice and shows the server's public message. Network-specific MoMo controls leave unaffected networks and rails available. Recovery updates existing controls without replacing a typed form. History, receipts, original-reference recovery and merchant shop saving remain reachable. Backend guards retain final authority. A SERVICE_PAUSED reply releases a local pending attempt only when the backend explicitly confirms no mutation; an unknown outcome retains its original reference.
+
+This release preserves the 2.10.6 assets, camera, QR, Lux, onboarding, payment review, conditional Pause and PIN journeys. All external MoMo and bank transfers remain labelled test-money simulations. No live provider monitoring or real external settlement is established by the native UI.
 
 Version 2.10.6 corrects the consumer recipient journey. Tapping a registered Lumo person immediately resolves their identity and opens their amount screen with name and @username; the directory is hidden during the check and no second Continue is required. Exact typed usernames can still use Continue. Duplicate taps, route/account changes and reassigned handles cannot redirect a draft.
 
